# SHA-256 of the frozen submission (model v5: models/emission_v4.txt, config/final_v4.yaml and
# config/final_v5.yaml), from `python tasks.py submission` on the official BAR-ATH data bundle.
# A hash reveals nothing about the labels. `python tasks.py submission --expect-sha256 recorded`
# checks a rerun against it. The earlier files' hashes are in submission_v4.sha256,
# submission_v3.sha256 and submission_v2.sha256.
